      hu: "A legnagyobb Windhoek három kastélya közül, amelyet Wilhelm Sander tervezett, ma pedig az olasz nagykövet rezidenciája.",
      ro: "Cel mai mare dintre cele trei castele din Windhoek, proiectat de Wilhelm Sander, care servește astăzi ca reședință a ambasadorului italian.",
      en: "The largest of the three castles of Windhoek, designed by Wilhelm Sander and now the residence of the Italian Ambassador."
